ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Jasper County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 years, more than any other pair, and it is also the driest pair at 5.29 inches. In 2025 on the middle, January to February came in at 46% of normal and November to December at 45%. In 2026 so far on the middle, March to April came in at 13% of normal.</p>"}
